WHAT THE EVIDENCE COVERS

REAL_DASHBOARDS.md, SCALE_BASIS_PREREG.md, MI_SCALING_PREREG.md and
AI_EVAL_PREREG.md record predictions made BEFORE the corresponding data
was fetched, and scored afterwards including the misses. The commit
history is what makes that ordering checkable rather than merely
asserted; a fork that rewrites history is not making the same claim.

